          <img src="static/guide_images/override_03_greyed_controls.png" alt="Image 3 — Hidden or greyed-out controls">

          <figcaption>

            <strong>Image 3 — Hidden or greyed-out controls.</strong> Manual controls may become hidden, locked, or greyed out when selected native files already control that part of the setup.

